together,

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:08.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we both thought
we were gonna get in.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:10.516
We just knew we were gonna
get in "In Living Color."

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:14.554
I went to the audition with
a bunch of props but nothing.

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:15.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I had --
-Like, no material.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:17.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I had no material.
-Okay, gotcha.

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:19.626 line:92%
-But I had a big styrofoam penis

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:21.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I thought
would really work.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:22.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:23.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
You didn't know what
you were gonna do with it?

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:25.632
You just thought,
"This is a good thing to have."

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:27.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's is a good thing to have.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.501 line:92%
Anyway, we both kind of bombed,

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
