Exactly.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:51.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you get
to work with Rita Moreno.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
That just must be amazing.
-Oh, she's fantastic.

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:56.596 size:84% position:42%
I mean, she's exactly
what you would imagine.

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:58.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's a living legend.
-Yeah.

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And she's
so dynamic and energetic,

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's
an incredible acting partner

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just a wonderful
human being to be around.

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:07.373 size:78% position:39% line:92%
So, yeah, it's great.

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:10.243 size:84% position:42%
It's great all around.
-Well, congratulations.

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:11.344 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'm so happy it's back,

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:12.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
